      "writtenOn": "2022-06-22T00:22:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Probably any of the possible events that an Alert can indicate would need to be handled by the DPM. So you could just make one new function `dpm_handle_alert` and pass in the whole ADO for parsing in the DPM. Just a thought. It seems nice to keep the DPM\u0027s API small, but I could go either way on this. I\u0027d probably lean more towards parsing in the DPM the more types of Alerts we handle.",
